melee-unlocked's audio buffer (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.7): the ring's slack on top of the device buffer can be set while the
output runs (audio_set_buffer_ms), so features/audio.cpp can run upstream's Auto policy (audio_buffer_policy.h: grow after
real gaps in a match, settle back while clean, remembered per output) or a fixed Low latency buffer instead of the fixed
40 ms. After 0110, against a build-time copy of port/runtime/host/audio_sdl.cpp (frontend/build.sh).
